
This directory contains all packages for EvtGen ....
Pythia8 and HepMC are part of the external packages.

The CMAKEList.txt files enables/disables sub-components.
You can disbale Photos and and Pythia8 for EvtGen, but this might not be useful.
Tauola is disabled by default as it has no relevance for PANDA.

Tauola contains
* TAUOLA.1.0.7-LHC.tar.gz
* TAUOLA.1.1.1a-LHC.tar.gz
* the CMakeList.txt
* the sub-folder "Tauloa" with softlinks for include files.

Photos contains
* PHOTOS.3.5.tar.gz
* PHOTOS.3.52.tar.gz
* the CMakeList.txt
* the sub-folder "Photos" with softlinks for include files.

R01-01-00 contains
* the subversion repository for EvtGen R01-01-00 as of 8.10.2012
* the CMakeList.txt
Changes!!: enum EROOR, WARNING, INFO etc collide with logger class from fairsoft.

R01-02-00 contains
* the stable "release" archive
* the CMakeList.txt
TODO Changes!!: enum EROOR, WARNING, INFO etc collide with logger class from fairsoft.

EvtGenDirect contains EvtGenDirect task for PandaRoot

